<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Water of life is the Spirit,</l><l>God as the life in it flows;</l><l>Carrying with it His Lordship,</l><l>Through every place where it goes.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Midst the gold street it floweth,</l><l>Thus showing to us the way;</l><l>As in God’s nature it floweth,</l><l>So in His way we will stay.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The tree of life by the river,</l><l>Shows to us God as our food;</l><l>We by the river’s full flowing</l><l>Take of the tree’s plenitude.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
